        aapt2 requires <adaptive-icon> resources to live in a folder with a -v26
        (or later) qualifier even when minSdk is already 26+, so lint's advice to
        merge mipmap-anydpi-v26 into mipmap-anydpi does not hold for launcher
        icons. Scoped to that folder only.
    -->
    <issue id="ObsoleteSdkInt">
        <ignore path="src/main/res/mipmap-anydpi-v26" />
    </issue>
</lint>
